  "description": "The Sommet 29 is race proven and capable on any terrain, attacking the downhills in search of bigger drops and steeper descents.\n\nThere is no limit to what the Sommet 29 can handle, with more traction and more control, you will experience the confidence to conquer the mountain. If you’re aiming for the enduro podium or want to push your riding to the limits on your favourite trail, the Sommet 29 is with you all the way.\n\nThe Sommet 29 VRS is no ordinary bike. The stunning paintwork, big wheels and big travel allow you to stand out from the crowd. Fox Float 36 Performance 170mm forks, Fox Float DPX2 performance rear shock and DT Swiss E1700 wheels fitted with Maxxis Assegai tyres means you have all the tools you need to master the hardest of trails. A Shimano XT / SLX 12 speed drivetrain combo, with Shimano SLX brakes, MRP chain guide is joined by a Nukeproof cockpit and a Brand-X Ascend Dropper to complete the stand out Sommet 29 VRS.\n\nSommet 160mm 6061 Alloy boost Frame\n\nFox Float 36 Performance 170mm fork\n\nShimano XT / SLX 12 speed drivetrain\n\nShimano SLX brakes, 203mm rotors\n\nBrand-X Ascend Internal dropper post\n\nMaxxis Assegai Tubeless ready tyres",
